20
00:02:14,439 --> 00:02:15,800
From now on, we're family.

21
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:16,639
Yeah, yeah.

22
00:02:16,879 --> 00:02:18,319
You're officially an honorary member.

23
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,360
Thank you so much.

24
00:02:28,879 --> 00:02:29,759
Louder!

25
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,360
Thank you so much.

26
00:02:33,319 --> 00:02:34,319
It's all because of you

27
00:02:34,319 --> 00:02:35,120
