40
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:56,199
The photos are good.

41
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,120
Thank you.

42
00:02:59,599 --> 00:03:00,680
The number of people in this group

43
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:01,800
