49
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:16,879
I'll add you to the group.

50
00:03:30,199 --> 00:03:31,159
I'll take a call.

51
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:33,000
OK.

52
00:03:33,479 --> 00:03:34,199
You go ahead.

53
00:03:36,159 --> 00:03:37,400
Is he

54
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,240
