55
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:40,080
It's okay.

56
00:03:41,039 --> 00:03:42,159
That's his character.

57
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,439
You'll know it later.

58
00:03:45,919 --> 00:03:47,280
What's that saying?

59
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:49,159
He is not as cold as he looks.

60
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:51,520
He is a warm person inside.

61
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:56,800
You're my savior.

62
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:58,560
By the way,

63
00:03:58,560 --> 00:03:59,280
when can he officially

64
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,240
join the basketball club?

65
00:04:26,759 --> 00:04:27,480
Director

66
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:28,519
This is the work report

67
00:04:28,519 --> 00:04:29,439
of the Arts Festival.

68
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:35,680
The winning team's prize money and certificates

69
00:04:36,079 --> 00:04:37,360
will be in place this week.

70
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:41,399
Our basketball team

71
00:04:41,399 --> 00:04:42,680
is really something.

72
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:45,319
But this time, the response was great.

73
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:47,399
My

74
00:04:47,399 --> 00:04:48,800
biggest concern

75
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:50,600
finally did something right.

76
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:54,800
Have you been keeping an eye on them lately?

77
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:56,959
Everything's been

78
00:04:56,959 --> 00:04:57,879
