79
00:04:58,120 --> 00:04:59,600
They've been training diligently every day.

80
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:00,600
No issues at all.

81
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:01,240
Good.

82
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:02,480
But...

83
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:03,800
What? Just say it.

84
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,240
They represent the school's honor,

85
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:07,439
giving it their all.

86
00:05:07,439 --> 00:05:08,519
At the Arts Festival,

87
00:05:08,519 --> 00:05:10,120
they achieved the best results.

88
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:11,759
They're too excellent

89
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:13,800
to continue being your

90
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:15,000
biggest headache.

91
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:20,959
Alright, I got it.

92
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:22,160
Anything else?

93
00:05:22,519 --> 00:05:23,680
Director, I'll go now.

94
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:24,639
Okay, go ahead.

95
00:05:32,199 --> 00:05:34,160
Fu Binyan, something is wrong with you.

96
00:05:35,399 --> 00:05:36,600
You criticize us,

97
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:37,519
