98
00:05:37,879 --> 00:05:39,319
and never want to join us.

99
00:05:39,959 --> 00:05:41,480
But you help us,

100
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:42,399
supervise us,

101
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,319
and even spoke well of us

102
00:05:43,319 --> 00:05:44,519
behind our backs.

103
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:46,959
You have a problem.

104
00:05:49,079 --> 00:05:50,360
I specifically inquired about you.

105
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:52,680
They said you like playing basketball very much,

106
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:54,120
and you are very good at it.

107
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,000
Your current

108
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:56,800
contradictory behavior

109
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:58,279
all point to one possibility.

110
00:05:58,600 --> 00:05:59,480
And I

111
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:00,800
have already guessed it.

112
00:06:01,079 --> 00:06:02,000
What?

113
00:06:02,279 --> 00:06:03,759
You don't join the Basketball Club

114
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:06,240
because you

115
00:06:12,759 --> 00:06:14,639
look down on us from the bottom of your heart.

116
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:17,560
Do you think

117
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:19,120
we are not good enough for you?

118
00:06:19,279 --> 00:06:20,720
You want us to grow first.

119
00:06:21,079 --> 00:06:22,639
When we are strong enough one day,

120
00:06:22,959 --> 00:06:24,319
you will join us.

121
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:27,000
Yes, that's it.

122
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:28,839
So, for the next group match,

123
00:06:28,839 --> 00:06:30,199
you all have to work hard.

124
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:35,600
Don't worry,

125
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,439
we will.

126
00:06:50,319 --> 00:06:51,160
Keep going, keep going.

127
00:07:07,319 --> 00:07:09,079
The coach lets us relax a bit.

128
00:07:09,079 --> 00:07:10,000
But aren't we

129
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:11,519
a bit too relaxed like this?

130
00:07:11,519 --> 00:07:13,000
It's okay.

131
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:21,600
Having fun

132
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:23,000
can bring out the best in us.

133
00:07:23,399 --> 00:07:23,800
Come on,

134
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:24,879
guys, keep going.

135
00:07:24,879 --> 00:07:25,480
Okay.

136
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:29,040
Fu Binyan,

137
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:30,160
do you want to join us?

138
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:43,920
Who let you play like this?

139
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:45,800
Coach,

140
00:08:00,199 --> 00:08:01,800
how could you not include me?

141
00:08:10,879 --> 00:08:12,319
Keep throwing,

142
00:08:12,319 --> 00:08:14,160
smash those balls down for me.

143
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:15,079
Yes!

144
00:08:21,839 --> 00:08:23,879
Good news!

145
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:28,240
What's the good news?

146
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,600
The Arts Festival awards

147
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:30,800
and the prize money have arrived!

148
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,080
We've got funding again!

149
00:08:32,919 --> 00:08:33,759
That's great!

150
00:08:34,279 --> 00:08:36,559
Now, everything's in place.

151
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:38,759
Our next game,

152
00:08:40,279 --> 00:08:43,480
Yibei will win!

153
00:09:19,039 --> 00:09:20,320
I can smell it

154
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:21,320
